key-cast

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Show the latest burst of keys as a pill above the bottom rows of a GIF that fades after the last key, and let a theme list all 256 indexed colours, so a terminal that derives 16 to 255 from its theme renders as it does there.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream evp shows the keys pressed in a recording and reads a theme's full 256-colour palette.
